
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Line endings, settled once. The same rule the record, ExamPrint and the
# Student Submission repositories already use.
#
# Without it, a file written by a Windows tool and the same file written by a
# Linux tool differ by their line endings alone, so a real edit hides inside a
# diff of nothing. Added 8 October 2026, after an editor rewrote a tracked file
# as CRLF twice in one evening and both times it was caught by eye rather than
# by anything that would have stopped it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
